    "page_content": "1. Audit Objective\nTo assess whether Order Intake was recognized and measured in accordance with POL-ORD-001 v1.0, and to\nevaluate the design and operating effectiveness of related controls (CTRL-REV-014).\n2. Background and Scope\nThis audit plan was developed for the FY2024 Q4 audit cycle, covering Order Intake transactions booked between\nJuly 2024 and October 2024. Scope includes:\n- Hardware/Software orders\n- Standalone Services orders\n- Bundled multi-element arrangements\n3. Key Risk Indicators (KRIs)",
