    "page_content": "4.2 Sample Selection Approach\n- Population: All orders booked Jul–Oct 2024 (n = 342)\n- Sample size: 15 orders, judgmentally selected across 3 regions\n- Stratification: Weighted toward orders >$50,000 and customers rated below B\n5. Testing Procedures Performed\n- Inspected PO documentation for existence and completeness\n- Traced credit rating classification to Group Credit Risk system\n- Recalculated booking date against PO receipt date per Section 5.4\n- Verified Finance Manager sign-off where credit rating below B\nCFO POLICY FRAMEWORK | CONTROLLED DOCUMENT Page 2",
